	(gr_text_box "changes:\n-all suggested from Setsuna & Shivam & presentation feedback\n	-removed r4 and r17\n	-kept multiple net names (following PCB Design Techniques - Spring 2025 from brightspace)\n	-fixed XTAL1 missing connection\n	-removed PWR_FLAG on GND\n	-removed D2 - no need\n	-increased via hole size (15 mil drill + 28 mil diameter)\n	-kept chamfer (compared prices on jlc and pcbway and same price)\n	-removed via on SW3\n	-did not change traces beneath oscillators, everythings already routed but will keep in mind for the future\n	-moved silkscreen names from off the board to on the board (we are still discussing decorative designs - if we include any)\n	-kept FB since FB should be near source of noise and source of noise we are trying to prevent is from the USB-C. if we are misunderstanding this please let us know.\n	-trace clearances updated, needed more with via size increase\n	-moved silkscren + labeled pins\n	-removed 3v connection from stlink. keeping only 5v\n	\n	-also, the led matrix connector somehow relapsed and changed to the 2x08 default header instead of a jtag type rectangular connector. updated and fixed :)\n\n\nFrom prof. walters feedback:\n-added back shield resistor\n-added tvs diodes for joystick + buttons\n-changed decoupling cap value\n"
		(start 98.4 17.4)
		(end 178.4 66)
		(margins 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025)
		(layer "User.1")
		(uuid "7851db99-38e0-4413-87fc-41a1c9c20b4a")
		(effects
